=You maintain a long-term memory file about one user. Output the COMPLETE, updated memory as a plain list — one durable fact per line, each starting with '- '.

Keep ONLY stable, reusable facts: name, role/business, location, preferences, ongoing goals, recurring topics. Do NOT store small talk, greetings, today's date, or one-off questions. Merge the new exchange into the existing memory: keep every fact that is still true, add anything new, and never exceed 12 lines. Output the list ONLY — no preamble, no commentary, no blank lines.

EXISTING MEMORY (may be empty):
{{ $('Extract Memory').item.json.data || '(empty)' }}

LATEST EXCHANGE:
User: {{ $('Set Input').item.json.user_message }}
Assistant: {{ $('Assistant').item.json.output }}
